#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:96
msgid "HOPE payments — country report financial feed."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:18
msgid ""
"Payments are dated by delivery date, then entitlement date, then status "
"date. Only payments in accepted, finished or closed payment plans are "
"included; failed, removed and conflicted payments are excluded. USD uses "
"delivered quantity when present, otherwise entitlement quantity. Payments "
"count counts payment records."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:24
msgid ""
"The metric toggle switches between USD and payment count. The selected "
"programme cohort and chart filters apply."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:29
msgid ""
"Payment pipeline from total payment volume through delivered to reconciled."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:30
msgid "HOPE payments and the completion reconciliation rate."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:32
msgid ""
"In pipeline is the total payment volume for the active metric — the funnel's "
"starting population, not only pending payments. Delivered counts "
"Distribution Successful, Partially Distributed and Transaction Successful. "
"Reconciled is delivered multiplied by the reconciliation rate from the "
"completion dataset for the same period and cohort."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:39
msgid ""
"Pending in pipeline is shown below the chart as a subset of in-pipeline, not "
"as a separate failure stage."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:43
msgid "Cash disbursed or payments by programme sector."
